+# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+# Punctuation (제6장 문장 부호, 제44-67항)
+# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+
+punctuation . 256
+# 소수점은 수 모드를 끊지 않음 (0.5 → ⠼⠚⠲⠑, ⠼ 재발화 없음 — NIKL 전수 우세)
+midendnumericmodechars .
+punctuation , 5
+punctuation ? 236
+punctuation ! 235
+punctuation - 36
+punctuation : 5-2
+punctuation ; 56-23
+
+# Parentheses (two-cell)
+punctuation ( 236-3
+punctuation ) 6-356
+
+# Brackets
+punctuation [ 236-23
+punctuation ] 56-356
+
+# Quotation marks (제52-53항; dot patterns identical in the 2024
+# revision). 로마자 종료표 is omitted before closing quotes/brackets
+# per 제34항.
+# 여는/닫는 큰따옴표 " " = 236 / 356; 작은따옴표 ' ' = 6-236 / 356-3
+punctuation \x201c 236
+punctuation \x201d 356
+punctuation \x2018 6-236
+punctuation \x2019 356-3
+
+# Korean-specific brackets
+punctuation \x300c 5-236
+punctuation \x300d 356-2
+punctuation \x300e 56-236
+punctuation \x300f 356-23
+punctuation \x300a 56-2356
+punctuation \x300b 2356-23
+punctuation \x3008 5-2356
+punctuation \x3009 2356-2
+
+punctuation \x2026 6-6-6
+always \x338f 356-13-1245-256
